<title>USA: Ballantyne of Omaha names Wilmers CEO.</title>
<headline>Ballantyne of Omaha names Wilmers CEO.</headline>
<dateline>OHAMA, Neb. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballantyne of Omaha Inc said Wednesday it had named John Wilmers president and chief executive. He succeeds Ronald Echtenkamp, 62, who will become vice chairman on March 1.</p>
<p>Wilmers, 52, is currently Ballantyne's executive vice president of sales and a board member.</p>
